git commit -m "feat: add browse-first lab showcase shell"
```

## Context

This is the second task in the seven-task Lab Showcase redesign. Task 1 already extracted the portfolio data and state foundation into:
- /Users/jensliew/MyPortfolio/scripts/portfolio-data.mjs
- /Users/jensliew/MyPortfolio/scripts/portfolio-state.mjs
- /Users/jensliew/MyPortfolio/tests/portfolio-state.test.mjs

Your job is to create the initial browse-first shell only. Do not wire full manual navigation yet, do not add detail markup yet, and do not rebuild the Three.js scene yet. Keep the work focused on the shell renderer, stylesheet foundation, simple app bootstrap, and the entry HTML rewrite that points at the new shell.

Because `index.html` currently contains the full old inline app, replace it carefully with the new entry shell while preserving the import map and CDN dependencies needed for later tasks. Keep the current `<video class="input_video" autoplay playsinline></video>` element because later gesture work still depends on it.

